    {
      "id": "EZR.1.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZR.1.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Now in the first year of Cyrus king of Persia, that the word of the LORD by the mouth of Jeremiah might be fulfilled, the LORD stirred up the spirit of Cyrus king of Persia, that he made a proclamation throughout all his kingdom, and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "put it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " also in writing, saying,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "EZR.1.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZR.1.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thus saith Cyrus king of Persia, The LORD God of heaven hath given me all the kingdoms of the earth; and he hath charged me to build him a house at Jerusalem, which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in Judah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZR.1.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZR.1.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is there",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " among you of all his people? his God be with him, and let him go up to Jerusalem, which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in Judah, and build the house of the LORD God of Israel, (he ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the God,) who ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in Jerusalem.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZR.1.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZR.1.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And whoever remaineth in any place where he sojourneth, let the men of his place help him with silver, and with gold, and with goods, and with beasts, besides the free-will-offering for the house of God that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in Jerusalem.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZR.1.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZR.1.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Then arose the chief of the fathers of Judah and Benjamin, and the priests, and the Levites, with all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " whose spirit God had raised, to go up to build the house of the LORD which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in Jerusalem.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZR.1.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZR.1.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And all they that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " about them strengthened their hands with vessels of silver, with gold, with goods, and with beasts, and with precious things, besides all ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " was willingly offered.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EZR.1.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:EZR.1.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Also Cyrus the king brought forth the vessels of the house of the LORD, which Nebuchadnezzar had brought from Jerusalem, and had put them in the house of his gods;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
